-load i18n

.flex.flex-col.p-12
  .page-title            
    -trans "Your message hub"
    
  .mt-2
    -blocktrans trimmed with name=brand.name
      This message panel allows you to keep track of everything coming in and out of {{name}}. As you send and receive
      messages, they'll be listed here.

  .mt-2
    -blocktrans trimmed with name=brand.name
      Just like your email, {{name}} allows you to view, label, and archive messages as you receive them. {{name}}
      uses labels to classify responses, so you can view and manage those messages here. You can also create your own
      labels to keep track of messages by topic.

  .mt-2
    -blocktrans trimmed with name=brand.name
      {{name}} also keeps track of calls received on your channel so you can return any missed calls
